<h1 class="page-title" data-page-title-uuid="f6cad624-37b7-5673-af29-80ba9aac61a5">Klingon Diplomatic Greeting Drafting (all) <a class="source-link" href="https://claude.ai/chat/c0000003-1701-4d00-8000-00000000c003" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">↗</a></h1>

<div id="m-ec2d712e-ffd8-5f3e-bfb1-291c371a8a18" data-section-uuid="ec2d712e-ffd8-5f3e-bfb1-291c371a8a18" class="msg msg--claude">

## 2369-04-14 10:00:00 UTC — Human

Look up the Klingon greeting "nuqneH" and propose a respectful opening line for a diplomatic dispatch to Chancellor K'mpec.

</div>

<div id="m-fba21d7b-ee94-5388-a431-83ab86883e1d" data-section-uuid="fba21d7b-ee94-5388-a431-83ab86883e1d" class="msg msg--claude">

## 2369-04-14 10:00:30 UTC — claude-opus-4-7

<details><summary>Thinking</summary>

> "nuqneH" literally means "what do you want" — it's blunt by Federation standards but standard among Klingons. I should fetch a phrasebook to confirm register before recommending an opening.

</details>

</div>

<div id="m-627106cd-9749-58b6-b3c3-081b7c5bd325" data-section-uuid="627106cd-9749-58b6-b3c3-081b7c5bd325" class="msg msg--claude">

